            "value" : "合并重复弹幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Merging shows a comment repeated within %lld seconds once, with a ×N count. Lower density thins comments evenly; comments repeated %lld or more times are always kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Merging shows a comment repeated within %1$lld seconds once, with a ×N count. Lower density thins comments evenly; comments repeated %2$lld or more times are always kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "まとめると、%1$lld秒以内に繰り返されたコメントを ×N 付きで1回だけ表示します。密度を下げると均等に間引きます。%2$lld回以上繰り返されたコメントは常に残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "合并会把 %1$lld 秒内重复的弹幕只显示一次，并标上 ×N 计数。降低密度会均匀减少弹幕；重复 %2$lld 次及以上的弹幕总会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
